"Main-binary IPA decryptor for apps already installed on this device. Run Kernel Chain (no tweak install), choose an app, probe FairPlay LC_ENCRYPTION_INFO, then Start Decrypt (Main Binary)." = "用於解密本機已安裝 App 主二進位檔的 IPA 解密工具。執行核心鏈（不需要安裝 tweak），選擇 App，檢測 FairPlay LC_ENCRYPTION_INFO，然後點選「開始解密（主二進位檔）」。";
"Decrypt path: arm KRW → find the live process → UUID-matched dump of the main Mach-O via DarkSword KRW → clear cryptid → pack Payload/*.app into Documents/DecryptedIPAs/*.ipa → share sheet." = "解密流程：啟用 KRW → 尋找正在執行的行程 → 透過 DarkSword KRW 按 UUID 配對並轉儲主 Mach-O → 清除 cryptid → 將 Payload/*.app 封裝為 Documents/DecryptedIPAs/*.ipa → 開啟分享面板。";
"No App Store login or remote download. Scope: main executable only; encrypted frameworks/extensions stay encrypted until image-matched dependency dump lands." = "不需要登入 App Store，也不會進行遠端下載。目前只處理主執行檔；在實作按映像配對的相依項目轉儲前，加密的 framework 和 extension 仍會保持加密。";
"Credits: main dump flow adapted from lara decrypt.m (neonmodder123)." = "鳴謝：主轉儲流程參考 lara 的 decrypt.m（neonmodder123）。";
"Beta / unstable: sends private SpringBoard lock-screen and biometric-resource messages. Always On runs SpringBoard timers while the device is locked, so disable it or respring if Face ID feels noisy or unstable." = "Beta / 不穩定：會送出私有 SpringBoard 鎖定畫面和生物辨識資源訊息。Always On 會在裝置鎖定時執行 SpringBoard 計時器；如果 Face ID 變得頻繁或不穩定，請停用它或 respring。";
"Beta: patches SpringBoard runtime methods in memory. Respring restores stock, but unsupported builds may glitch the app switcher or crash SpringBoard. Re-run after any respring." = "Beta：在記憶體中修補 SpringBoard 執行階段方法。respring 會恢復原生狀態，但不支援的系統可能導致 App 切換器異常或 SpringBoard 當機。每次 respring 後需要重新執行。";
"Beta: persistent CallServices system-file replacement. Disclosure sounds may be legally required where you live; you are responsible for your use and apply this at your own risk. Use Restore Original Sounds before removing Cyanide if you want Cyanide's backups written back." = "Beta：持久化取代 CallServices 系統檔案。你所在地可能依法要求保留提示音；使用風險由你自行承擔。若希望 Cyanide 寫回備份，請在移除 Cyanide 前使用 Restore Original Sounds。";
"Beta: RemoteCall-only physics can be reset by SpringBoard relayouts such as page swipes, rotations, folder transitions, or resprings. Use Restore Icon Layout if icons stay displaced." = "Beta：純 RemoteCall 物理效果可能被 SpringBoard 重新佈局重設，例如翻頁、旋轉、資料夾切換或 respring。如果圖示停留在錯誤位置，請使用 Restore Icon Layout。";
