"Cleanup" = "清理回呼";
"Define an optional global cleanup() function for scripts that change in-memory state:\n\nglobalThis.cleanup = function () {\n  r_msg2_main(view, \"setHidden:\", 0);\n  clearInterval(timer);\n};\n\nCyanide calls cleanup() before it stops a running script during Clean Up, package disable/removal, or session shutdown. Restore only state captured by the script before it changed it. Keep cleanup() synchronous and fast. Persistent file or system changes cannot be restored automatically." = "對於會修改記憶體狀態的腳本，可定義可選的全域 cleanup() 函式：\n\nglobalThis.cleanup = function () {\n  r_msg2_main(view, \"setHidden:\", 0);\n  clearInterval(timer);\n};\n\nCyanide 會在清理、停用/移除軟體包或會話結束前呼叫 cleanup()。只還原腳本修改前自行儲存的狀態。cleanup() 必須同步且快速完成。持久化的檔案或系統修改無法自動還原。";
"Write .js scripts that run inside SpringBoard through Cyanide's RemoteCall bridge. Publish them as a source repo or load them locally with QuickLoader." = "編寫透過 Cyanide RemoteCall 橋接、在 SpringBoard 內執行的 .js 腳本。可將其發佈為來源儲存庫，或使用 QuickLoader 在本機載入。";
"A tweak is a plain .js file that runs inside JavaScriptCore. 64-bit pointers are passed as hex strings (e.g. \"0x105f2a000\"). Wrap your code in an IIFE:\n\n(() => {\n  log(\"Hello from my tweak!\");\n  var app = r_msg2(\n    r_class(\"UIApplication\"),\n    \"sharedApplication\");\n  var win = r_msg2(app, \"keyWindow\");\n  // …\n})();\n\nUse log() to print to Cyanide's Log tab. Use r_msg2_main() instead of r_msg2() for anything that touches UIKit views." = "Tweak 是在 JavaScriptCore 中執行的一般 .js 檔案。64 位元指標會以十六進位字串傳遞（例如 \"0x105f2a000\"）。請使用 IIFE 包裝程式碼：\n\n(() => {\n  log(\"Hello from my tweak!\");\n  var app = r_msg2(\n    r_class(\"UIApplication\"),\n    \"sharedApplication\");\n  var win = r_msg2(app, \"keyWindow\");\n  // …\n})();\n\n使用 log() 輸出到 Cyanide 的日誌 Tab。所有涉及 UIKit view 的操作都應使用 r_msg2_main()，不要使用 r_msg2()。";
"Add @param comments at the top of your script. Cyanide parses them and generates native UI controls in Settings.\n\nSyntax:\n// @param: type | varName | Label | default | range\n\nTypes:\n\nswitch — Boolean toggle\n// @param: switch | enabled | Enable Tweak | true\n\ntext — String text field\n// @param: text | label | Custom Text | Hello\n\ncolor — Hex color picker (#RRGGBB or #RRGGBBAA)\n// @param: color | tint | Tint Color | #00FFCC80\n\nslider — Numeric slider with range\n// @param: slider | radius | Blur | 5.0 | 0.0-10.0\n\nDefault values auto-populate on first install. The slider shows a \"(Def)\" indicator when at the declared default." = "在腳本頂部加入 @param 註解。Cyanide 會解析這些註解，並在設定中建立原生 UI 控制項。\n\n語法：\n// @param: type | varName | Label | default | range\n\n類型：\n\nswitch — 布林開關\n// @param: switch | enabled | Enable Tweak | true\n\ntext — 字串輸入欄\n// @param: text | label | Custom Text | Hello\n\ncolor — 十六進位顏色選擇器（#RRGGBB 或 #RRGGBBAA）\n// @param: color | tint | Tint Color | #00FFCC80\n\nslider — 具範圍的數值滑桿\n// @param: slider | radius | Blur | 5.0 | 0.0-10.0\n\n首次安裝時會自動填入預設值。滑桿位於宣告的預設值時會顯示 \"(Def)\" 標示。";
"These functions are injected into every JS context:\n\nlog(message)\n  Print to Cyanide's log console.\n\nr_class(name) → pointer\n  Get an Objective-C class pointer.\n  r_class(\"UIApplication\")\n\nr_sel(name) → pointer\n  Convert a string to a native SEL.\n\nr_nsstr(string) → pointer\n  Allocate an NSString in SpringBoard.\n  Call r_msg2(ptr, \"release\") when done.\n\nr_msg2(target, selector, a1, a2, a3, a4)\n  Send an ObjC message. Up to 4 args.\n\nr_msg2_main(target, selector, a1, a2, a3, a4)\n  Same but forced onto the main thread.\n  Required for all UIKit/view changes.\n\nr_responds(target, selector) → bool\n  Check if an object responds to a selector." = "這些函式會注入到每個 JS context：\n\nlog(message)\n  輸出到 Cyanide 日誌主控台。\n\nr_class(name) → pointer\n  取得 Objective-C class 指標。\n  r_class(\"UIApplication\")\n\nr_sel(name) → pointer\n  將字串轉換為原生 SEL。\n\nr_nsstr(string) → pointer\n  在 SpringBoard 中配置 NSString。\n  使用完畢後呼叫 r_msg2(ptr, \"release\")。\n\nr_msg2(target, selector, a1, a2, a3, a4)\n  傳送 ObjC 訊息，最多 4 個參數。\n\nr_msg2_main(target, selector, a1, a2, a3, a4)\n  相同操作，但強制在主執行緒執行。\n  所有 UIKit/view 修改都必須使用它。\n\nr_responds(target, selector) → bool\n  檢查物件是否回應 selector。";
"QuickLoader scripts can read their @param values at runtime:\n\nr_pref_num(\"blurRadius\")   → float\nr_pref_bool(\"enableBlur\")  → boolean\nr_pref_str(\"tintColor\")    → string\n\nRepoTweaks scripts receive their parameters as pre-injected global variables instead." = "QuickLoader 腳本可在執行時讀取 @param 值：\n\nr_pref_num(\"blurRadius\")   → float\nr_pref_bool(\"enableBlur\")  → boolean\nr_pref_str(\"tintColor\")    → string\n\nRepoTweaks 腳本則會以預先注入的全域變數形式接收參數。";
"Standard timer functions are mapped to GCD background queues so they never block the UI:\n\nsetInterval(fn, ms) → id\nclearInterval(id)\nsetTimeout(fn, ms) → id\nclearTimeout(id)\n\nAll active timers are automatically cancelled when the tweak is disabled or Cyanide cleans up." = "標準計時器函式會對應到 GCD 背景佇列，因此不會阻塞 UI：\n\nsetInterval(fn, ms) → id\nclearInterval(id)\nsetTimeout(fn, ms) → id\nclearTimeout(id)\n\n停用 tweak 或 Cyanide 清理時，所有作用中的計時器都會自動取消。";
"64-bit IPC can't pass CGFloat arrays directly. Allocate colors through CIColor:\n\nvar hex = \"#00FFCC80\".replace('#','');\nvar r = parseInt(hex.substring(0,2),16)/255;\nvar g = parseInt(hex.substring(2,4),16)/255;\nvar b = parseInt(hex.substring(4,6),16)/255;\nvar a = parseInt(hex.substring(6,8),16)/255;\nvar str = r_nsstr(r+\" \"+g+\" \"+b+\" \"+a);\nvar ci = r_msg2(\n  r_class(\"CIColor\"),\n  \"colorWithString:\", str);\nvar ui = r_msg2(\n  r_class(\"UIColor\"),\n  \"colorWithCIColor:\", ci);\nr_msg2_main(view, \"setBackgroundColor:\", ui);\nr_msg2(str, \"release\");" = "64 位元 IPC 不能直接傳遞 CGFloat 陣列。請透過 CIColor 配置顏色：\n\nvar hex = \"#00FFCC80\".replace('#','');\nvar r = parseInt(hex.substring(0,2),16)/255;\nvar g = parseInt(hex.substring(2,4),16)/255;\nvar b = parseInt(hex.substring(4,6),16)/255;\nvar a = parseInt(hex.substring(6,8),16)/255;\nvar str = r_nsstr(r+\" \"+g+\" \"+b+\" \"+a);\nvar ci = r_msg2(\n  r_class(\"CIColor\"),\n  \"colorWithString:\", str);\nvar ui = r_msg2(\n  r_class(\"UIColor\"),\n  \"colorWithCIColor:\", ci);\nr_msg2_main(view, \"setBackgroundColor:\", ui);\nr_msg2(str, \"release\");";
"• Always use r_msg2_main for view manipulation — r_msg2 on a background thread can crash SpringBoard.\n• Release r_nsstr allocations to avoid leaking memory in the SpringBoard process.\n• Use r_responds to check selectors before calling them — iOS versions differ.\n• Test locally with QuickLoader before publishing to a repo.\n• Only run and publish scripts you trust. JS tweaks have full RemoteCall access." = "• 操作 view 時務必使用 r_msg2_main，在背景執行緒呼叫 r_msg2 可能使 SpringBoard 崩潰。\n• 釋放 r_nsstr 配置的物件，避免 SpringBoard 程序發生記憶體洩漏。\n• 呼叫前使用 r_responds 檢查 selector，不同 iOS 版本可能不同。\n• 發佈到儲存庫前先用 QuickLoader 在本機測試。\n• 只執行及發佈可信腳本，JS tweak 擁有完整的 RemoteCall 存取權。";
