"These are already installed, not new pending changes. Confirming re-runs the chain so RemoteCall-backed tweaks come back after a force-quit. To stop one from running, deactivate it from the Packages tab, or use Reset All Packages in Settings → Quick Actions." = "這些項目已安裝，不是新的待處理變更。確認後會重新執行 chain，讓依賴 RemoteCall 的 tweak 在強制退出後恢復。若要停止某項，請在套件標籤頁停用它，或在設定 → 快速操作中使用重設所有套件。";
