"Main-binary IPA decryptor (beta) for apps already installed on this device. Use Run Kernel Chain to arm KRW without installing any Installer tweak, choose an app, then Start Decrypt (Main Binary).\n\nDecrypt path: arm KRW → find the live process → UUID-matched dump of the main Mach-O → pack Payload/*.ipa into Documents/DecryptedIPAs → share sheet.\n\nNo App Store login or remote download. Encrypted frameworks/appex/dylibs stay encrypted until image-matched dep dump lands." = "面向本機已安裝應用程式的主二進位檔 IPA 解密器（測試版）。執行核心鏈即可啟用 KRW，無需安裝任何 Installer tweak；接著選擇應用程式並點選「開始解密（主二進位檔）」。\n\n解密路徑：啟用 KRW → 尋找執行中的程序 → 依 UUID 比對轉儲主 Mach-O → 將 Payload/*.ipa 封裝到 Documents/DecryptedIPAs → 開啟分享面板。\n\n不包含 App Store 登入或遠端下載。加密的 framework、appex 與 dylib 會保持加密，直到支援依 image 比對的相依項轉儲。";
"Target process not found. Open the selected app once, keep it in memory, then retry decrypt." = "未找到目標程序。請先開啟所選應用程式一次並保持其在記憶體中，然後重試解密。";
