"Main-binary IPA decryptor (beta). Use Run Kernel Chain on this page to arm KRW without installing any Installer tweak. Then choose an app and Start Decrypt (Main Binary).\n\nDecrypt path: arm KRW → find the live process → UUID-matched dump of the main Mach-O → pack Payload/*.ipa into Documents/DecryptedIPAs.\n\nEncrypted frameworks/appex/dylibs stay encrypted until image-matched dep dump lands. Optional App Store download is still encrypted until dump. SINF re-sign is out of scope." = "主二進位檔 IPA 解密器（測試版）。在此頁面執行核心鏈即可啟用 KRW，無需安裝任何 Installer tweak。接著選擇應用程式並點選「開始解密（主二進位檔）」。\n\n解密路徑：啟用 KRW → 尋找執行中的程序 → 依 UUID 比對轉儲主 Mach-O → 將 Payload/*.ipa 封裝到 Documents/DecryptedIPAs。\n\n加密的 framework、appex 與 dylib 會保持加密，直到支援依 image 比對的相依項轉儲。可選 App Store 下載在轉儲前仍為加密內容。SINF 重新簽章不在範圍內。";
