"Start Decrypt (Main Binary)" = "開始解密（主二進位檔）";
"Requires KRW. Decrypts only the main executable via process-path-matched dump, then packs a Payload IPA. Encrypted frameworks/extensions are left encrypted until image-matched dep dump lands." = "需要 KRW。僅透過程序路徑比對的記憶體轉儲解密主執行檔，然後封裝為 Payload IPA。加密的 framework 與擴充功能會保持加密，直到支援依 image 比對的相依項轉儲。";
"Main-binary IPA decryptor (beta). Select an installed user app, run the kernel chain, then Start Decrypt (Main Binary). Cyanide launches the target if needed, matches the live process by executable path (not basename), dumps FairPlay-decrypted pages for the main Mach-O only, clears cryptid, and writes Payload/*.ipa to Documents/DecryptedIPAs.\n\nEncrypted frameworks, appex, and dylibs are inventoried and left encrypted — dependency dump is disabled until image-path matching exists. Optional App Store download still yields an encrypted IPA until a main-binary dump runs. SINF/iTunesMetadata re-sign is out of scope." = "主二進位檔 IPA 解密器（測試版）。選擇已安裝應用程式，執行核心鏈後點選「開始解密（主二進位檔）」。Cyanide 會在需要時啟動目標應用程式，透過執行檔路徑比對執行中的程序，僅轉儲主 Mach-O 已解密的 FairPlay 頁面，清除 cryptid，並將 Payload/*.ipa 寫入 Documents/DecryptedIPAs。\n\n加密的 framework、appex 與 dylib 僅會列出並保持加密；在實作 image 路徑比對前，相依項轉儲維持停用。可選的 App Store 下載在執行主二進位檔轉儲前仍是加密 IPA。SINF/iTunesMetadata 重新簽章不在範圍內。";
"Main-binary FairPlay dump → Payload IPA" = "主二進位檔 FairPlay 轉儲 → Payload IPA";
"Main-binary IPA decryptor for installed user apps. Select a target (or paste an App Store link, sign in, and fetch an encrypted IPA), probe FairPlay LC_ENCRYPTION_INFO, then Start Decrypt (Main Binary).\n\nDecrypt path: run the Cyanide kernel chain → launch/find the process whose executable path matches the selected app (not basename-only) → dump decrypted __TEXT crypt pages for the main Mach-O via DarkSword KRW → clear cryptid → pack Payload/*.app into Documents/DecryptedIPAs/*.ipa.\n\nScope: main executable only. Encrypted frameworks, app extensions, and dylibs are listed in the result and left encrypted until image-matched dependency dump is implemented. Optional App Store download still yields an encrypted IPA until dump runs. SINF/iTunesMetadata re-sign is not included.\n\nCredits: main dump flow adapted from lara decrypt.m (neonmodder123)." = "面向已安裝使用者應用程式的主二進位檔 IPA 解密器。選擇目標應用程式（或貼上 App Store 連結、登入並下載加密 IPA），探測 FairPlay LC_ENCRYPTION_INFO 後，點選「開始解密（主二進位檔）」。\n\n解密路徑：執行 Cyanide 核心鏈 → 啟動/尋找執行檔路徑與所選應用程式相符的程序（非僅按名稱）→ 透過 DarkSword KRW 轉儲主 Mach-O 已解密的 __TEXT 加密頁面 → 清除 cryptid → 將 Payload/*.app 封裝為 Documents/DecryptedIPAs/*.ipa。\n\n範圍：僅主執行檔。加密的 framework、應用程式擴充功能與 dylib 會在結果中列出並保持加密，直到實作依 image 比對的相依項轉儲。可選的 App Store 下載在轉儲前仍為加密 IPA。不包含 SINF/iTunesMetadata 重新簽章。\n\n致謝：主轉儲流程改編自 lara 的 decrypt.m（neonmodder123）。";
"⚠️ Beta main-binary only — requires live KRW and a path-matched running target. Encrypted frameworks/extensions are NOT dumped. App Store download + SINF patching remain experimental." = "⚠️ 測試版，僅主二進位檔：需要可用的 KRW 與路徑相符的執行中目標。不會轉儲加密的 framework/擴充功能。App Store 下載與 SINF 修補仍屬實驗性功能。";
