"Cyanide is a limited tweak environment. Session tweaks reset on reboot, while a few packages intentionally modify local system files and may persist until restored. Backups are best-effort only. Use these tools only where you have permission, understand the legal and service-rule impact, and accept the risk. Live tweaks like StatBar and Axon Lite stop if you force-quit Cyanide. A progress log opens while changes apply; tap Hide to dismiss." = "Cyanide 是一個能力受限的 tweak 環境。工作階段型 tweak 會在重新開機後重置；少數軟體包會有意修改本機系統檔案，並可能持續到恢復為止。備份只是盡力而為。請只在你有權限、理解法律和服務規則影響並接受風險的情況下使用這些工具。像 StatBar 和 Axon Lite 這樣的即時 tweak 會在強制退出 Cyanide 後停止。套用變更時會開啟進度日誌；點選隱藏即可關閉。";
