"Enables Apple's internal UIKit debugging overlay in SpringBoard. After applying, double-tap the status bar to open it. Its settings page controls whether Clean Up or exiting Cyanide restores the original behavior; respring always restores stock." = "在 SpringBoard 中啟用 Apple 內部 UIKit 除錯浮層。套用後，雙擊狀態列即可開啟。可在該功能的設定頁中決定執行 Clean Up 或結束 Cyanide 時是否還原原始行為；respring 一律會恢復原狀。";
