"Allows SpringBoard's Home Screen and Lock Screen to rotate into upside-down portrait orientation. Rotation Lock must be off. Its settings page controls whether Clean Up or exiting Cyanide restores the original behavior; respring always restores stock." = "允許 SpringBoard 主畫面和鎖定畫面旋轉到倒置直向。必須關閉旋轉鎖定。可在該功能的設定頁中決定執行 Clean Up 或結束 Cyanide 時是否還原原始行為；respring 一律會恢復原狀。";
"Restore automatically" = "自動還原";
