"Switches between two selected still images based on left/right device tilt. It inserts SpringBoard wallpaper layers through RemoteCall and keeps a lightweight motion loop alive while active.\n\nCompatibility: LiveWP, Metal Lock Light, and Mood Wallpaper all own the wallpaper layer space. Only one wallpaper effect can be active at a time." = "依裝置左右傾斜方向，在 2 到 8 張選定的靜態圖片之間切換。它會透過 RemoteCall 向 SpringBoard 插入桌布圖層，並在啟用期間保持一個輕量的重力偵測迴圈。\n\n相容性：LiveWP、Metal Lock Light 與趣味桌布都會接管桌布圖層空間，因此同一時間只能啟用一種桌布效果。";
"Experimental: switches SpringBoard wallpaper layers by device tilt. Disable it or respring if the wallpaper layer looks wrong." = "實驗功能：依裝置傾斜方向切換 SpringBoard 桌布圖層。如果桌布圖層顯示異常，請停用它或重新啟動 SpringBoard。";
