"Mood Wallpaper switches between two selected images based on left/right device tilt. It owns the same SpringBoard wallpaper layer space as LiveWP and Metal Lock Light, so only one wallpaper effect can be active at a time." = "趣味桌布會依裝置左右傾斜方向，在兩張選定圖片之間切換。它與 LiveWP、Metal Lock Light 使用同一套 SpringBoard 桌布圖層空間，因此同一時間只能啟用一種桌布效果。";
"Mood Wallpaper switches between 2 to 8 selected images based on left/right device tilt. It owns the same SpringBoard wallpaper layer space as LiveWP and Metal Lock Light, so only one wallpaper effect can be active at a time." = "趣味桌布會依裝置左右傾斜方向，在 2 到 8 張選定圖片之間切換。它與 LiveWP、Metal Lock Light 使用同一套 SpringBoard 桌布圖層空間，因此同一時間只能啟用一種桌布效果。";
