"Install from the Installer tab and tap Run. Clean Up attempts to restore the stock Dock; a respring always restores it." = "請在安裝程式頁面安裝後點擊執行。清理會嘗試恢復系統預設 Dock；respring 一定會恢復。";
"Scene controller" = "場景控制器";
"Creates and reuses SpringBoard's internal iPad Dock controller in the active scene, including the App Library button. Clean Up restores the stock Dock for the current session; a respring also restores it." = "在目前場景中建立並重複使用 SpringBoard 內部的 iPad Dock 控制器，包括 App 資料庫按鈕。清理會在目前工作階段恢復系統預設 Dock；respring 也會恢復。";
"Enables the iPad-style Dock with App Library" = "啟用包含 App 資料庫的 iPad 風格 Dock";
"Creates and reuses SpringBoard's internal iPad Dock controller in the active scene, including the App Library button.\n\nThe patch writes no system files. Clean Up restores the stock Dock for the current session; a respring also restores the stock Dock." = "在目前場景中建立並重複使用 SpringBoard 內部的 iPad Dock 控制器，包括 App 資料庫按鈕。\n\n此修補不會寫入系統檔案。清理會在目前工作階段恢復系統預設 Dock；respring 也會恢復系統預設 Dock。";
"Uses private SpringBoard scene controllers and changes Dock capability gates in memory. Unsupported builds may glitch the Dock, respring SpringBoard, or crash it." = "使用 SpringBoard 私有場景控制器，並在記憶體中修改 Dock 功能開關。不支援的系統版本可能導致 Dock 顯示異常、SpringBoard respring 或當機。";
"Saved repo script" = "已儲存的 repo 腳本";
"%@ is not shown in the standalone editor. Clear it here to prevent future automatic runs." = "%@ 不會顯示在獨立編輯器中。在此清除它可阻止之後自動執行。";
"Docs" = "文件";
"How tweaks work" = "Tweak 的運作方式";
"Read sbcustomizer.m, statbar.m, rssidisplay.m, and axonlite.m in Cyanide/tweaks/ for shipped patterns at increasing complexity." = "可閱讀 Cyanide/tweaks/ 中的 sbcustomizer.m、statbar.m、rssidisplay.m 和 axonlite.m，了解由淺入深的已發佈實作模式。";
"Cyanide tweaks are app-side drivers. No SpringBoard dylibs, no Substrate hooks, no swizzled methods. The app reaches into the target from outside." = "Cyanide tweak 是 App 端的驅動程式：沒有 SpringBoard dylib、沒有 Substrate hook，也沒有方法 swizzle。App 會從外部操作目標程序。";
"A RemoteCall session is the bridge. From inside one you send Objective-C messages, read and write memory, and call C symbols in the target process." = "RemoteCall session 是橋梁。透過它可向目標程序傳送 Objective-C 訊息、讀寫記憶體，以及呼叫 C symbol。";
"Settings holds the SpringBoard channel during Apply Tweaks. Your code runs inside it under settings_rc_lock(), via three entrypoints: apply_in_session, optional stop_in_session, and forget_remote_state." = "執行 Apply Tweaks 時，Settings 會持有 SpringBoard 通道。你的程式碼在 settings_rc_lock() 保護下透過三個入口執行：apply_in_session、可選的 stop_in_session 和 forget_remote_state。";
"The remote_objc API" = "remote_objc API";
"_main variants dispatch to the target main thread (use them for UIKit). _raw passes non-pointer arguments by value. r_msg2_main_struct_ret copies struct returns such as CGRect." = "_main 變體會調度到目標主執行緒（UIKit 應使用它們）。_raw 會按值傳遞非指標參數。r_msg2_main_struct_ret 可複製 CGRect 等結構體回傳值。";
"Import remote_objc.h and ../TaskRop/RemoteCall.h. Helpers assume an active session — don't call init_remote_call yourself unless you need a private channel." = "匯入 remote_objc.h 和 ../TaskRop/RemoteCall.h。輔助函式假設已有作用中的 session，除非需要私有通道，否則不要自行呼叫 init_remote_call。";
"A minimal tweak" = "最小 Tweak 範例";
"Drop both files in Cyanide/tweaks/. The Xcode project uses PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup, so new files are picked up automatically — no pbxproj edits needed." = "將兩個檔案放入 Cyanide/tweaks/。Xcode 專案使用 PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup，會自動識別新檔案，無需修改 pbxproj。";
"A complete RemoteCall-only tweak: paints an 80×80 red square on a SpringBoard window." = "一個完整的僅 RemoteCall tweak：在 SpringBoard 視窗上繪製 80×80 的紅色方塊。";
"Idempotent on reapply, undoes itself on stop, drops cached pointers on respawn." = "重複套用時保持冪等，停止時自行復原，respawn 時丟棄快取指標。";
"Wiring into Settings" = "接入 Settings";
"Mirror an existing kSettings…Enabled path — search kSettingsStatBarEnabled or kSettingsAxonLiteEnabled for a complete template covering defaults, rows, package state, Run, live apply, stop, and cleanup." = "參考現有的 kSettings…Enabled 路徑。搜尋 kSettingsStatBarEnabled 或 kSettingsAxonLiteEnabled，可看到涵蓋預設值、設定列、套件狀態、Run、即時套用、停止和清理的完整範本。";
"SettingsViewController.m is the orchestrator. Add five things: a defaults key, a switch row, a Run-path apply, a live-apply branch, and forget_remote_state in cleanup." = "SettingsViewController.m 是協調器。需加入五項：預設設定 key、開關列、Run 路徑的 apply、即時套用分支，以及清理中的 forget_remote_state。";
"Every apply checks g_springboard_rc_ready inside @synchronized(settings_rc_lock()). settings_mark_tweak_applied() keeps package state honest. forget_remote_state() runs on respring and abandon." = "每次 apply 都會在 @synchronized(settings_rc_lock()) 內檢查 g_springboard_rc_ready。settings_mark_tweak_applied() 保持套件狀態正確；forget_remote_state() 會在 respring 和 abandon 時執行。";
"Porting from Theos / Substrate" = "從 Theos / Substrate 移植";
"Shipped templates: sbcustomizer (dock layout), darksword_tweaks (SpringBoard state toggles), powercuff (thermalmonitord one-shot), statbar (overlay window), rssidisplay (per-icon overlays), axonlite (cached NC state)." = "已發佈範本：sbcustomizer（Dock 版面）、darksword_tweaks（SpringBoard 狀態開關）、powercuff（thermalmonitord 單次操作）、statbar（覆蓋視窗）、rssidisplay（逐圖示覆蓋層）、axonlite（快取的通知中心狀態）。";
"RemoteCall isn't a hook framework. You can't intercept a method or replace a C function in place." = "RemoteCall 不是 hook 框架，不能攔截方法或原地替換 C 函式。";
"Ports work when the effect is a finite mutation — set this property, call this controller method, add this view, hold this assertion, or refresh on a timer." = "當效果可表示為有限次修改時，移植才適用：設定屬性、呼叫控制器方法、加入 view、保持 assertion 或透過計時器重新整理。";
"Targeting another process? Open a separate session with init_remote_call(name, false), do the work, destroy_remote_call before switching back. Powercuff does this for thermalmonitord." = "需要操作其他程序？使用 init_remote_call(name, false) 建立獨立 session，完成工作後在切回前 destroy_remote_call。Powercuff 對 thermalmonitord 就是如此。";
"Contribute" = "貢獻";
"Build with ./scripts/build.sh — the IPA is packaged under build/. Sideload, test on device, attach Log-tab output to your PR." = "使用 ./scripts/build.sh 建置，IPA 會輸出到 build/。側載後在真機測試，並將 Log Tab 輸出附到你的 PR。";
"Source and issues: https://github.com/zeroxjf/cyanide" = "原始碼與 Issue：https://github.com/zeroxjf/cyanide";

