"How to use:" = "使用方式：";
"• Tap the dot in the bottom-right corner of the screen to open the picker." = "• 點選螢幕右下角的圓點開啟選擇器。";
"• Tap two apps to launch them side-by-side." = "• 點選兩個 App，使其並排啟動。";
"• Drag the top bar to move; drag any corner to resize." = "• 拖曳頂部列移動視窗；拖曳任意角調整大小。";
"• X in the top-left of a window closes it." = "• 點選視窗左上角的 X 關閉視窗。";
"• Gear in the picker tray jumps back to Cyanide settings." = "• 點選選擇器托盤中的齒輪返回 Cyanide 設定。";
"First Run is slow. The picker has to enumerate every installed app over RemoteCall and build a tile per app — expect 1-2 minutes on a fresh install. Re-Runs reuse the cache and are fast." = "首次執行較慢。選擇器需要透過 RemoteCall 列舉所有已安裝 App，並為每個 App 建立卡片；全新安裝時預計需要 1–2 分鐘。再次執行會重用快取，速度較快。";
"Rough edges:" = "已知限制：";
"• Touch routing into hosted apps isn't wired — windows are for viewing/switching, not scrolling or typing." = "• 託管 App 的觸控轉送尚未接通；視窗目前適合檢視和切換，不能捲動或輸入。";
"• Auto-close on full-screen launch is not yet hooked up; close manually with the X." = "• 全螢幕啟動時尚不會自動關閉懸浮視窗，請使用 X 手動關閉。";
"• Gestures may stutter while the App Library is still filling in." = "• App 資料庫仍在載入時，手勢可能出現卡頓。";
"Beta / unstable: First Run takes 1-2 minutes because the picker enumerates every installed app and builds a tile per app. Re-Runs are fast. Touch routing into hosted windows isn't wired yet, so scrolling/typing inside a floating window may not work." = "Beta / 不穩定：首次執行需要列舉全部已安裝 App 並建立卡片，可能耗時 1–2 分鐘；再次執行會更快。託管視窗的觸控轉送尚未完成，因此視窗內捲動和輸入可能無法使用。";
"Cylinder Lite" = "Cylinder Lite";
"Page-level Home Screen transition animations" = "主畫面翻頁動畫";
"Animates the current Home Screen page container when you swipe between pages. This RemoteCall-only Lite version does not animate individual icons, does not hook SpringBoard continuously, and does not write icon layout state.\n\nChoose an effect in Settings. The first version uses a lightweight page monitor and Core Animation on SBIconListView." = "在主畫面翻頁時，為目前頁面容器加入動畫。這個 RemoteCall-only Lite 版本不會逐個圖示做動畫，不會持續 hook SpringBoard，也不會寫入圖示佈局狀態。\n\n可在設定中選擇效果。目前第一版使用輕量頁面監控，並對 SBIconListView 套用 Core Animation。";
"First version: page-level animation only. It may miss a swipe if SpringBoard changes Home Screen internals or if Cyanide is suspended." = "第一版：僅支援頁面級動畫。如果 SpringBoard 內部結構變化，或 Cyanide 被暫停，可能會漏掉一次翻頁。";
"Page Animation" = "頁面動畫";
"Animates the current Home Screen page container when the page changes. It does not animate individual icons or write icon layout state." = "主畫面頁面變化時，為目前頁面容器加入動畫。它不會逐個圖示做動畫，也不會寫入圖示佈局狀態。";
