"Cylinder Lite, Watch Layout, Gravity Lite, SBCustomizer, and Home Layout Extras all affect Home Screen page/icon layout. Only one should be active at a time." = "Cylinder Lite、Watch Layout、Gravity Lite、SBCustomizer 和主畫面佈局增強都會影響主畫面頁面或圖示佈局。同一時間只應啟用其中一個。";
