"Cylinder Lite did not start cleanly." = "Cylinder Lite 未能正常啟動。";
"Page-level Home Screen transition animations. Cyanide watches the active SpringBoard icon page and applies a lightweight Core Animation effect when the page changes.\n\nIt does not animate individual icons, does not write icon layout state, and Clean Up restores the stock page behavior for the current session." = "主畫面頁面級翻頁動畫。Cyanide 會監控目前 SpringBoard 圖示頁面，並在頁面變化時套用輕量 Core Animation 效果。\n\n它不會逐個圖示做動畫，不會寫入圖示佈局狀態；清理會在目前工作階段中恢復原生頁面行為。";
